              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "RMSR"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used fat-free and sugar-free yogurt which is definitely more liquid-y than Greek-style so I didn't have any issues with it being too thick as others mentioned. Depending on what you're drizzling this over, you can add some zest, switch up the extract or even add food colouring."
