              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Katie Jones Taito"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm extremely lactose intolerant, so I used sheep yogurt. It came out liquidy even after 30 minutes in the freezer. But it tasted delicious after I poured it on a cake.",
