              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made the recipe as described, and it worked beautifully. It is a thick glaze, but that is exactly what I was looking for. I am tried of thin and runny glazes and wanted something that would hold its color on a dark chocolate cake. The greek yogurt gives it some richest/ depth of flavor, and it is super simple.",
